{"v":4,"catch":"冰球Namco Cup今天開賽。","desc":"《Face Off》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1988年推出的運動遊戲。這是一款使用左右搖桿和射擊按鈕的冰球遊戲。\n從 8 種類型中選擇你最喜歡的球隊並贏得錦標賽。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-02-08","genres":["運動","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9301d3425d9ba149fe7d3834f2dccc05fb3890a542fdf40dfbbb3623c8d72815.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a4cbb76cc9182e76e6650c3f5963c3d091fa20dda84aa876b8f938cad8e252a9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/edf1557922b691be77b29d1666ea95910d005cbdf2778c6eb6d5a1b44c869684.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e42bc26a17676d61e98d3127d7a614893e06f49f46760a39c624c0b6e316ac9e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/12574ff73f6e3f6e844f47cc876a739d7c9ce58cfd8a109ef8d4de5f329fafed.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b1a97e574001589ff9341894bc22381489980c00bb1ee1f8f16c728f9b0cf73a.jpg"],"titleId":"01002a301d44e000","dlc":[]}